# Copyable Means Code Block

When Dee says "copyable" or "make it copyable" or "copyable in the chat" — she means:

**Put the content in a markdown code block so the copy icon appears in the upper right corner.**

## Example

When Dee asks for a copyable email:

```
Subject: RE: Follow-up

Hi Christine,

This is the email content.

Dee Davis
President & CEO
Dee Davis Inc.
248.376.4550 | info@deedavis.biz
```

## Rules

- ALWAYS use a fenced code block (triple backticks) for copyable content
- NEVER just paste raw text in the chat without the code block
- This applies to: emails, scripts, messages, any content Dee needs to copy-paste
- Do NOT ask "want it copyable?" — if it's something she'll copy-paste, make it copyable by default
- Do NOT explain what copyable means — just do it
